{"step_index":2016,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-23T21:22:30Z","content":"I have created the detailed implementation plan covering the **World-Class Enhancement Roadmap** and the **Hybrid Calendar Integration Suite**:\n\n- **Hybrid Calendar Piping:** 1-Tap Apple Calendar (`.ics`), Google Calendar, and Outlook Web synchronization with 15-minute pre-bell alarms.\n- **Campus-Clustered Geodialing:** Instant school filtering to batch call educators on the same campus back-to-back.\n- **Live Objection Battlecards HUD:** 1-Tap verbatim talk-tracks for Florida educator objections directly in the dialer cockpit.\n- **Planning Period Visual Heatmap:** Weekly calendar grid (Period 1–7) to prevent double-booking.\n- **Two-Way CSV / Excel Pipeline Sync:** 1-Click Excel export and staff roster bulk import.\n\nPlease review the plan in [implementation_plan.md](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/brain/9c9b5ef4-82a1-483f-9e9e-cb421c9396b3/implementation_plan.md) and let me know if you would like me to proceed with the build!"}
