{"step_index":2018,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-23T21:22:32Z","thinking":"**Initiating Implementation Steps**\n\nI've got the green light on the artifact! My focus is now on executing the implementation plan. First up, I'm diving into the `calendarService.ts` file. Specifically, I'm starting by implementing the `createIcsContent(event)` function. This is the first tangible step toward our goal.\n\n\n**Expanding Calendar Functionality**\n\nI've made headway! I've fleshed out the calendar features, ensuring RFC 5545 compliance with a pre-alarm. I've implemented `downloadIcsFile`, `getGoogleCalendarUrl`, `getOutlookCalendarUrl`, and `openAppleCalendar`, enhancing compatibility across platforms. Next up, I will develop the objection battlecard data.\n\n\n**Prioritizing Features Integration**\n\nI'm now zeroing in on integrating features. I'm focusing on the periods scheduling functionality, specifically the before/after school sit-downs, and linking them to `AppNavigator.tsx` and `ListsScreen.tsx`. Then, I'll concentrate on implementing campus-clustered dialing, adding new functions to `LeadsRepository` and the campus filter. Finally, I will focus on updating the Dialer HUD Screen and the Lead Detail Screen, integrating the Objection Battlecards and calendar piping. After that is complete, I'll update the Settings Screen and prepare for deployment.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"run_command","args":{"CommandLine":"@\"\nimport { Platform } from 'react-native';\nimport { Lead } from '../types';\n\nexport interface CalendarEventPayload {\n  title: string;\n  description: string;\n  location: string;\n  startDate: Date;\n  endDate: Date;\n  alarmMinutes?: number;\n  contactName?: string;\n  contactPhone?: string;\n}\n\nexport class CalendarService {\n  /**\n   * Builds an RFC 5545 compliant .ics calendar event string\n   */\n  static generateIcsString(event: CalendarEventPayload): string {\n    const formatDate = (date: Date): string => {\n      return date.toISOString().replace(/[-:]/g, '').split('.')[0] + 'Z';\n    };\n\n    const nowStr = formatDate(new Date());\n    const startStr = formatDate(event.startDate);\n    const endStr = formatDate(event.endDate);\n    const uid = `snapdialer_${Date.now()}_${Math.random().toString(36).substring(2, 9)}@valuteachers.com`;\n    const alarmMins = event.alarmMinutes || 15;\n\n    // Escape special characters per RFC 5545\n    const cleanText = (str: string) =>\n      str.replace(/\\\\/g, '\\\\\\\\').replace(/;/g, '\\\\;').replace(/,/g, '\\\\,').replace(/\\n/g, '\\\\n');\n\n    return [\n      'BEGIN:VCALENDAR',\n      'VERSION:2.0',\n      'PRODID:-//ValuTeachers//SnapDialer FRS Scheduling Engine//EN',\n      'CALSCALE:GREGORIAN',\n      'METHOD:PUBLISH',\n      'BEGIN:VEVENT',\n      `UID:${uid}`,\n      `DTSTAMP:${nowStr}`,\n      `DTSTART:${startStr}`,\n      `DTEND:${endStr}`,\n      `SUMMARY:${cleanText(event.title)}`,\n      `LOCATION:${cleanText(event.location)}`,\n      `DESCRIPTION:${cleanText(event.description)}`,\n      'STATUS:CONFIRMED',\n      'BEGIN:VALARM',\n      `TRIGGER:-PT${alarmMins}M`,\n      'ACTION:DISPLAY',\n      `DESCRIPTION:Reminder: ${cleanText(event.title)}`,\n      'END:VALARM',\n      'END:VEVENT',\n      'END:VCALENDAR',\n    ].join('\\r\\n');\n  }\n\n  /**\n   * Triggers download or direct opening of the .ics file (Apple Calendar / Outlook on iOS/Mac/PC)\n   */\n  static downloadIcsFile(event: CalendarEventPayload): boolean {\n    try {\n      const icsData = this.generateIcsString(event);\n      const filename = `FRS_SitDown_${(event.contactName || 'Educator').replace(/\\s+/g, '_')}.ics`;\n\n      if (typeof window !== 'undefined') {\n        const blob = new Blob([icsData], { type: 'text/calendar;charset=utf-8' });\n        const url = URL.createObjectURL(blob);\n        const a = document.createElement('a');\n        a.href = url;\n        a.download = filename;\n        document.body.appendChild(a);\n        a.click();\n        document.body.removeChild(a);\n        URL.revokeObjectURL(url);\n        return true;\n      }\n      return false;\n    } catch (e) {\n      console.error('Failed to export .ics calendar file:', e);\n      return false;\n    }\n  }\n\n  /**\n   * Generates Google Calendar web composer direct link\n   */\n  static getGoogleCalendarUrl(event: CalendarEventPayload): string {\n    const formatGDate = (d: Date) => d.toISOString().replace(/[-:]/g, '').split('.')[0] + 'Z';\n    const dates = `${formatGDate(event.startDate)}/${formatGDate(event.endDate)}`;\n    const base = 'https://calendar.google.com/calendar/render?action=TEMPLATE';\n\n    const params = new URLSearchParams({\n      text: event.title,\n      dates: dates,\n      location: event.location,\n      details: event.description,\n    });\n\n    return `${base}&${params.toString()}`;\n  }\n\n  /**\n   * Generates Microsoft Outlook Web / Office 365 composer direct link\n   */\n  static getOutlookCalendarUrl(event: CalendarEventPayload): string {\n    const base = 'https://outlook.live.com/calendar/0/deeplink/compose';\n    const params = new URLSearchParams({\n      subject: event.title,\n      startdt: event.startDate.toISOString(),\n      enddt: event.endDate.toISOString(),\n      location: event.location,\n      body: event.description,\n    });\n    return `${base}?${params.toString()}`;\n  }\n\n  /**\n   * Opens Google Calendar directly in browser\n   */\n  static openGoogleCalendar(event: CalendarEventPayload) {\n    const url = this.getGoogleCalendarUrl(event);\n    if (typeof window !== 'undefined') {\n      window.open(url, '_blank');\n    }\n  }\n\n  /**\n   * Opens Outlook Calendar directly in browser\n   */\n  static openOutlookCalendar(event: CalendarEventPayload) {\n    const url = this.getOutlookCalendarUrl(event);\n    if (typeof window !== 'undefined') {\n      window.open(url, '_blank');\n    }\n  }\n\n  /**\n   * Creates a pre-populated event payload for a ValuTeachers Educator\n   */\n  static buildEducatorEvent(\n    lead: Lead,\n    scheduledDate: Date,\n    durationMinutes: number = 20,\n    customNotes?: string\n  ): CalendarEventPayload {\n    const endDate = new Date(scheduledDate.getTime() + durationMinutes * 60000);\n    const roomStr = lead.room_number ? `Room ${lead.room_number}` : 'Classroom';\n    const schoolStr = lead.school || 'Campus';\n    const planningStr = lead.planning_period ? ` (${lead.planning_period})` : '';\n\n    const title = `🎯 FRS Sit-Down: ${lead.name}${planningStr}`;\n    const location = `${schoolStr} • ${roomStr}`;\n\n    const description = [\n      `ValuTeachers FRS & Retirement Review with ${lead.name}`,\n      `School: ${schoolStr} • ${roomStr}`,\n      `Planning Period: ${lead.planning_period || 'Not specified'}`,\n      `Phone: ${lead.phone}`,\n      lead.years_in_frs ? `Years in FRS: ${lead.years_in_frs}` : null,\n      lead.frs_interests?.length ? `Focus Topics: ${lead.frs_interests.join(', ')}` : null,\n      lead.custom_questions ? `Card Inquiries: \"${lead.custom_questions}\"` : null,\n      customNotes ? `Appointment Notes: ${customNotes}` : null,\n    ]\n      .filter(Boolean)\n      .join('\\n');\n\n    return {\n      title,\n      description,\n      location,\n      startDate: scheduledDate,\n      endDate,\n      alarmMinutes: 15,\n      contactName: lead.name,\n      contactPhone: lead.phone,\n    };\n  }\n}\n\"@ | Set-Content -Path \"src/services/calendarService.ts\" -Encoding utf8\n","Cwd":"C:\\Users\\brorm\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\snap-dialer","WaitMsBeforeAsync":5000,"toolAction":"Creating calendarService.ts","toolSummary":"Create calendarService.ts"}}]}
